5,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know how the money works so nobody gets stuck with extra costs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I need to see the total cost before we agree to anything, to avoid surprises.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I am curious about how the space affects our time together versus alone.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am worried about how much time we lose just getting to the place.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I need to know about the bathroom and where I can sit without being on a bed.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Sakura,,@Victoria That makes sense. I also want to check how last year's separate rooms cost.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,@Sakura Agreed. I will look at the all-in rates versus buying meals separately.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,I will check the time alone in the shared-house year and how last year's days ran.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will look at ferry sailings and train time to see the travel burden.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I will check bathing hours and bathroom provision, and inn mealtimes and room arrangements.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Sakura,,@Daisuke That sounds important. I hope it helps you sleep better.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio If the travel is too long, we might need to reconsider the options.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I think understanding the rhythm of the days is key for our group harmony.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria Yes, efficiency is important. I will see if the train is faster.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,@Midori Thank you. I just want a place where I can wash and rest easily.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Okay, let's see what we find out. I am excited to plan this properly.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will keep my notes ready for the next round.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,I hope we find a balance that works for everyone.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will calculate the time lost in transit carefully.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I will look for details on the quiet spots in the accommodation.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
