35,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"I found that separate rooms cost nearly 8,000 yen more for some people last time.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"I saw that offshore houses are about 5,400 yen a head a night, with food on top.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Last year, two of us didn't meet from breakfast to dinner because we moved separately.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The ferry takes two days total, but the train to the spa valley is only ninety minutes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The island houses have one bathroom for everyone, and the water runs cold.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Sakura,,@Victoria That offshore price seems reasonable if we split it evenly.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura Yes, but I need to know if meals are included or extra.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,@Toshio Ninety minutes is much better than two days of travel.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,@Midori Exactly. The train option saves us a lot of time at both ends.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,@Victoria One bathroom for five people sounds difficult for me.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Sakura,,@Daisuke That is a valid concern. Maybe the inn has better facilities?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,I also checked all-in rates. They charge the same for light and heavy eaters.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,I think the city option might be too scattered for us to feel connected.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"The city has trains every few minutes, so moving around is easy there.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"The inn has fixed mealtimes, which might be stressful if I am not hungry.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"I prefer the idea of a single bill for the house, but the bathroom issue worries me.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I am leaning towards the option where I can see the total cost clearly.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I want us to be together, but I also need some space to breathe.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,The spa town seems like a good compromise on time and togetherness.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I am still unsure. I need to think about the bathing hours more.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
