60,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"So we have Island, City, and Hot Spring Town. Which one feels right?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"The Island has a clear per-head cost, but the bathroom situation is risky.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Midori,,The Hot Spring Town offers a shared experience without the chaos of a big city.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,The train to the Hot Spring Town is efficient. I like that.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The inn at the Hot Spring Town has fixed times, but the baths are open late.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Sakura,,@Victoria I agree the Island bathroom is a problem.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,@Sakura Yes. I think the Hot Spring Town might be the safest bet for cost and comfort.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Midori,,I feel the Hot Spring Town allows for both togetherness and individual space.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Toshio,,I am voting for the Hot Spring Town. The travel time is minimal.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I am worried about the fixed dinner time, but the baths sound nice.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Sakura,,I will vote for the Hot Spring Town too. It seems balanced.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I am also leaning towards the Hot Spring Town. The cost is predictable.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Midori,,I am happy to go with the group. The Hot Spring Town sounds peaceful.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I think we are all converging on the same choice.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will try to adjust to the schedule. I will vote for the Hot Spring Town.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Sakura,,It seems we are all on the same page.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,I am glad we can agree without too much conflict.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Midori,,I hope it is a wonderful trip for all of us.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I will book the train tickets as soon as we confirm.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,Thank you for listening to my concerns. I am ready to go.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
